# BodyCast UI design authority

Thin Cursor adapter. Full contract: `.agents/skills/bodycast-design-system/SKILL.md` and `AGENTS.md`.

1. Load the BodyCast Design System Skill first. It is authoritative.
2. Treat `src/app/globals.css` as the CURRENT visual token source.
3. Generic design skills may supplement hierarchy, accessibility, and performance. They never override BodyCast.
4. Inspect the target route, neighbors, spacing, and desktop/mobile behavior before editing. Do not design in isolation.
5. Verify visual work in a real browser at 360 / 390 / 768 / 1280. Tests alone are not UI acceptance.
6. Reuse existing BodyCast components and tokens. No unsolicited global redesign or generic AI dashboard aesthetics.
